{"4639780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NOT ENOUGH SPACE", "steam_appid": 4639780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4754930], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/f8f17b49a2500879b50ee98f9feb399f.avif?t=1787135180\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras_big/f8f17b49a2500879b50ee98f9feb399f.webp?t=1787135180 width=1560 height=120 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/7224e44c684ea85f18f5e637377c27dd.poster.avif?t=1787135180\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/7224e44c684ea85f18f5e637377c27dd.webm?t=1787135180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/7224e44c684ea85f18f5e637377c27dd.mp4?t=1787135180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D space action roguelike where every shot pushes you in the opposite direction. There is no standard movement: to dodge, chase, escape, or correct your position, you have to fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/d471af7e63b23671c40a59d29f068902.avif?t=1787135180\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras_big/d471af7e63b23671c40a59d29f068902.webp?t=1787135180 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/98912723a6d0f246f3be22d68d7f0730.poster.avif?t=1787135180\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/98912723a6d0f246f3be22d68d7f0730.webm?t=1787135180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/98912723a6d0f246f3be22d68d7f0730.mp4?t=1787135180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is built around recoil. Aim too carelessly, and you drift straight into danger. Time your shots well, and the same burst can kill an enemy, dodge an attack, and send you toward the next objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/d49d1b7145ece9b9947c37475df61df1.avif?t=1787135180\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras_big/d49d1b7145ece9b9947c37475df61df1.webp?t=1787135180 width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/3105e7e115514725b891d69fef6fdb37.poster.avif?t=1787135180\" width=320 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/3105e7e115514725b891d69fef6fdb37.webm?t=1787135180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/3105e7e115514725b891d69fef6fdb37.mp4?t=1787135180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile space zones, destroy enemies, open chests, and collect upgrades that reshape your run. Stack damage, fire rate, survivability, effects, and strange synergies until the screen turns into controlled chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/265fa58776d2ab732f67337329654de8.avif?t=1787135180\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras_big/265fa58776d2ab732f67337329654de8.webp?t=1787135180 width=1560 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/9c14e2aab97578457f53231808326148.poster.avif?t=1787135180\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/9c14e2aab97578457f53231808326148.webm?t=1787135180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639780/extras/9c14e2aab97578457f53231808326148.mp4?t=1787135180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level pushes you deeper into danger. Clear fights, gather power, survive bullet-heavy encounters, and reach the boss with whatever build the run has given you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com